title: bar:toggle
tags: [[GUI command]] [[Status bar and task bar]]
kind: reference
summary: Hide the task bar or the question bar, or show it again

`bar:toggle tasks` hides the task bar, or shows it again; `bar:toggle question` does
the same for a script's question bar. A hidden bar comes back by itself with its next
new entry — a task, a question — and a bar shown with nothing in it is one dimmed
line. See [[Status bar and task bar]].
